{"id":"bc72c7a211eea473","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-mm-unification-termination.md","title":"任意选规则的合一过程终止","display":"thm-mm-unification-termination — 任意选规则的合一过程终止","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-mm-unification-termination","aliases":["56-thm-mm-unification-termination"],"display":"thm-mm-unification-termination — 任意选规则的合一过程终止","depends_on":["[[56-df-mm-unification-step]]","[[56-df-mm-unification-measure]]","[[56-df-mm-unification-run]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Theorem 7.7.6 and proof","source_printed_pages":"293–294","source_ocr_blocks":[314,315],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-mm-unification-termination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-mm-unification-termination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mm-unification-termination — 任意选规则的合一过程终止"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ab7b6083e677200\" href=\"?note=6ab7b6083e677200\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-step\">56-df-mm-unification-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e0a062a6861b59d\" href=\"?note=6e0a062a6861b59d\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-measure\">56-df-mm-unification-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38760d0fb2c20b34\" href=\"?note=38760d0fb2c20b34\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-run\">56-df-mm-unification-run</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Theorem 7.7.6 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"293–294"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>314</span><span>315</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G,S,\\mathcal G_\\bot\">\\(\\mathcal G,S,\\mathcal G_\\bot\\)</span> 与合一步骤见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6ab7b6083e677200\" href=\"?note=6ab7b6083e677200\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-step\">56-df-mm-unification-step</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex3}}\">\\(\\mu,&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex3}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e0a062a6861b59d\" href=\"?note=6e0a062a6861b59d\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-measure\">56-df-mm-unification-measure</a>，有限极大运行见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"38760d0fb2c20b34\" href=\"?note=38760d0fb2c20b34\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-run\">56-df-mm-unification-run</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall E,F\\in\\mathcal G\\,\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;(E\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F\\Rightarrow\\mu(F)&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex3}}\\mu(E)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall E,F\\in\\mathcal G\\,\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;(E\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F\\Rightarrow\\mu(F)&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex3}}\\mu(E)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(E_i\\xrightarrow{\\delta_i}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_{i+1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(E_i\\xrightarrow{\\delta_i}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_{i+1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\exists\\delta\\in S\\,\\exists F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;(E\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F)\\iff E\\in\\{\\varnothing,\\bot\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\exists\\delta\\in S\\,\\exists F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;(E\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F)\\iff E\\in\\{\\varnothing,\\bot\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall E\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n\\;\\bigl(E_0=E\\land\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall E\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n\\;\\bigl(E_0=E\\land\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>核对原书定理7.7.6的终止证明。每个不失败步骤都不把已解变量变成未解变量。分解至少删去一个左根函数符号；删除x=x在u不下降时减l；交换在u不下降时删去整个非变量左项的函数符号；消去若x在余目标出现则u至少下降1，否则余目标不变，u和f不增且l下降。集合中的重复方程合并只会进一步减少计数。自然数三元组字典序良基，失败后无后继，所以无无限运行。任意非空目标取一个方程：按左右是否为变量、是否同根及是否自出现，可适用六条规则中的一条。对μ作良基归纳：末端给出零步极大运行，非末端选一步接上后继的有限极大运行，故每个输入目标均存在有限极大运行；这一步补足过程总性的显式存在断言。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-mm-unification-step","status":"resolved","id":"6ab7b6083e677200