\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(E_i\\xrightarrow{\\delta_i}_{\\mathrm{MM}}E_{i+1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\exists\\delta\\in S\\,\\exists F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot\\;(E\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F)\\iff E\\in\\{\\varnothing,\\bot\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall E\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol E\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n\\;\\bigl(E_0=E\\land\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2635,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-mm-unification-termination.md]]"},{"id":"3c8230787b91c51f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}$，$\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n$。假设 $\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)$，并令 $a=\\operatorname{Answer}(\\boldsymbol\\delta)$。运行、目标解集和幂等性见 [[56-thm-mm-run-invariant]] 及其运行接口，终止及末端分类见 [[56-thm-mm-unification-termination]]，二项MGU接口见 [[56-df-mgu]]。"}],"outgoing":["6ab7b6083e677200","6e0a062a6861b59d","38760d0fb2c20b34"]}